Z||000001||MinnGreenGT||09-07-2001||04:23 PM||||Austin-<P>Welcome to the forum... if in the gallery you were looking at a Gold GT with a "Shogun" style front end- bad new. It was photoshop!  Chris West at West Coast Fieros is putting one on a car... but no photos yet.  The F355 style in around if you like it (check with PISA... they have it, as do others).  Also check with Kal (Fiero_Momo) at <A HREF="http://www.thefibersmith.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.thefibersmith.com</A>  he has a new style front end as well!  Another member, AUSFiero is also working on a "Stage 2" front end and body kit that won't be available for awhile- check his stuff out at <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroshop.com.au</A>  (I think that's right).  Good Luck!<P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg">   <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett<P><p>[This message has been edited by MinnGreenGT (edited 09-07-2001).]||||reg||1
